# The pseudo-locale build mode. `vite --mode pseudo` / `vite build --mode pseudo`
# load this file; nothing else does, so a normal dev server and a normal build
# are unaffected.
#
# What it turns on: `src/lib/i18n/pseudo.ts` renders every key through a
# transform that marks it `⟦…⟧` and lengthens it 35%. Arabic runs 4-8% wider
# than English and `AR` is deliberately empty, so this is the only way to see an
# Arabic-shaped layout failure before a translator writes a word.
VITE_PSEUDO_LOCALE=1
